# Check every file out exactly as committed, on every OS. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote line endings of files no rule below hermes/ covers (the
# LICENSE of a seed skill), so the skill's git tree id no longer matched skills-reviewed.json
# and the Windows stage failed. Hermes' own hermes/.gitattributes is more specific and still
# wins for the files it names (its *.ps1 are CRLF everywhere).
* -text
